---
to: docs/DFLSS_DFMEA_WORKSHEET.md
force: true
sparql:
  risks: |
    PREFIX dflss: <https://ggen.dev/dflss#>
    SELECT ?risk ?severity ?occurrence ?detection ?rpn ?controlPlan WHERE {
      ?risk a dflss:DFMEARisk ;
        dflss:severity ?severity ;
        dflss:occurrence ?occurrence ;
        dflss:detection ?detection .
      OPTIONAL { ?risk dflss:rpn ?rpn }
      OPTIONAL { ?risk dflss:hasControlPlan ?controlPlan }
    } ORDER BY DESC(?rpn)
---
# DFLSS DFMEA Worksheet

| Risk | Severity | Occurrence | Detection | RPN | Control plan |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for r in risks %}| {{ r.risk }} | {{ r.severity }} | {{ r.occurrence }} | {{ r.detection }} | {{ r.rpn | default(value="—") }} | {{ r.controlPlan | default(value="none") }} |
